## What it is

Auto-configuration is one of Spring Boot's most powerful features. It **automatically configures your Spring application based on the dependencies you have added to your project**. For example, if you include `spring-boot-starter-data-jpa`, Spring Boot will automatically configure a `DataSource`, persistence manager, and other related components.

